","quote":"有車丞相，長陵人也。卒而有韋丞相代。韋丞相賢者，魯人也。以讀書術為吏，至大鴻臚。有相工相之，當至丞相。有男四人，使相工相之，至第二子，其名玄成。相工曰：「此子貴，當封。」韋丞相言曰：「我即為丞相，有長子，是安從得之？」後竟為丞相，病死，而長子有罪論，不得嗣，而立玄成。玄成時佯狂，不肯立，竟立之，有讓國之名。後坐騎至廟，不敬，有詔奪爵一級，為關內侯，失列侯，得食其故國邑。韋丞相卒，有魏丞相代。","source_term":"有長子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji096-014","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"vna_am7_jn5"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p005430"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-096","chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-096-zhang:m022-0099","c-shiji-096-zhang:m022-0119"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-096-zhang:p022"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-096-zhang"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji096-014","subject_person_id":"vna_am7_jn5_B","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"vna_am7_jn5","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p022","quote":"有車丞相，長陵人也。卒而有韋丞相代。韋丞相賢者，魯人也。以讀書術為吏，至大鴻臚。有相工相之，當至丞相。有男四人，使相工相之，至第二子，其名玄成。相工曰：「此子貴，當封。」韋丞相言曰：「我即為丞相，有長子，是安從得之？」後竟為丞相，病死，而長子有罪論，不得嗣，而立玄成。玄成時佯狂，不肯立，竟立之，有讓國之名。後坐騎至廟，不敬，有詔奪爵一級，為關內侯，失列侯，得食其故國邑。韋丞相卒，有魏丞相代。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"有長子","historicity":"historical_tradition","birth_order":{"scope":"sons_of_parent","parent_person_id":"vna_am7_jn5","ordinal":1,"position":"eldest","interpretation_status":"source_attested"}},"interpretation_note":"按原文明示親屬保存；父事不作生父，繼位不自行推父子，不補闕代或同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_p